{"chapter-slug":"rwInterlude - Strategists at Sea (Pt- 2)","paragraph":987,"wording":"[Pirate Captain]","event":"named","holder-slug":"captain-rasea","holder-quote":"Rasea whirled as Venaz charged her from the left. She slashed and the Minotaur halted. She ducked as Peki kicked at her head; she was too fast! And her body lit up in a flash.","id":"8029b02f-3259-5380-a373-32efd74a893b"}
{"chapter-slug":"rwInterlude - Strategists at Sea (Pt- 2)","paragraph":1103,"wording":"[Pirate Captain]","event":"named","holder-slug":"captain-rasea","holder-quote":"Eight landed on the deck, scattering [Storm Sailors]. Lord Seagrass stared as Rasea the Shining pulled her hat out of her bag of holding. His warship was the largest ship on the sea bar none. Hundreds of [Storm Sailors] for each of the [Pirates]. But more [Pirate] and Drowned Ships were sailing on his ship.","id":"d734cb36-f787-592a-83c8-f7a01c3acb48"}
{"chapter-slug":"rwInterlude - Strategists at Sea (Pt- 2)","paragraph":1228,"wording":"[Pirate Captain]","event":"named","holder-slug":"captain-rasea","holder-quote":"Captain Rasea Zecrew crowed. She grinned; she’d swung off her ship again! She reached down—and a fake Wil tackled her. The [Pirate Captain] cursed.","id":"ecf66e26-f6d2-5028-97a2-e92c98f0f890"}
